      "sourceTextSha256": "066934a0f86fe39bc3a434676f09d912addcb3328a18d714335b89b23332fc84",
      "text": "This itinerary takes you through several very different regions of Colombia. In Bogotá, explore colonial neighbourhoods and museums, visit Plaza de Bolívar and head up Monserrate. Pereira and the Cocora Valley bring you into the green Andes, where you will visit coffee plantations and learn how coffee is produced. In Cartagena, you reach the Caribbean coast before spending three days at leisure on San Andrés. The final leg takes you through Medellín and Guatapé to Lake Guatavita and the underground Salt Cathedral of Zipaquirá.",
